<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
   <%- include('../partials/head'); %>
</head>
<body>

   <%- include('../partials/header'); %>

  <section class="about-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #27BEF5, #6DD5FA); padding: 60px 20px; text-align: center; color: white;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 760px;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.4rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 12px;">M&aacute;s sobre nosotros</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; opacity: 0.95; line-height: 1.6;">
        En <strong>CuidArte</strong>, nuestra misi&oacute;n es ser el puente de confianza y bienestar que une a las familias con los mejores profesionales del cuidado.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-team" style="padding: 50px 20px; background: #f9fafb;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 960px;">
      <h2 class="team-title" style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 28px;">Nuestro Equipo</h2>

      <div class="team-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 22px; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 28px auto;">
        <div class="team-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align: center; border: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
          <div class="team-card-image" style="height: 240px; overflow: hidden; background: #e0f2fe;">
            <img src="/assets/image/santiago.png" alt="Santiago - CuidArte" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;">
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-content" style="padding: 18px;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">Santiago Grajales Franco</h3>
            <p class="role" style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #0284c7; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; background: #e0f2fe; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px;">Co-fundador</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="team-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align: center; border: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
          <div class="team-card-image" style="height: 240px; overflow: hidden; background: #fce7f3;">
            <img src="/assets/image/keren.png" alt="Keren - CuidArte" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top;">
          </div>
          <div class="team-card-content" style="padding: 18px;">
            <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">Keren Tatiana Becerra Molina</h3>
            <p class="role" style="margin: 6px 0 0 0; color: #be185d; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.88rem; background: #fce7f3; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 20px;">Co-fundadora</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-description" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); border: 1px solid #f3f4f6; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p style="margin: 0; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.7; text-align: center; font-size: 0.95rem;">
          Comprendemos la profunda responsabilidad y el amor que implica buscar el apoyo ideal para nuestros seres queridos mayores.
          Somos una plataforma dise&ntilde;ada para fomentar el bienestar integral y la salud emocional de la persona mayor, brindando tranquilidad y apoyo a sus familias y cuidadores.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats-section" style="background: white; padding: 30px 20px; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; text-align: center;">
        <div class="stat-item" style="padding: 10px;">
          <div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #27BEF5;">10+</div>
          <div class="stat-label" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Especialidades</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item" style="padding: 10px;">
          <div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #27BEF5;">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Compromiso</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item" style="padding: 10px;">
          <div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #27BEF5;">24/7</div>
          <div class="stat-label" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Disponibilidad</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item" style="padding: 10px;">
          <div class="stat-number" style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #27BEF5;">&#8734;</div>
          <div class="stat-label" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Dedicaci&oacute;n</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-vision-values" style="padding: 50px 20px; background: #f9fafb;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 980px;">
      <h2 class="team-title" style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; color: #1f2937; margin-bottom: 28px;">Nuestra Esencia</h2>

      <div class="mvv-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 20px;">
        <div class="mvv-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: center; border-top: 4px solid #27BEF5;">
          <div class="mvv-icon" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #e0f2fe; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 14px auto; font-size: 1.4rem;">&#127919;</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">Misi&oacute;n</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6;">Ser el puente que une a las familias con cuidadores especializados para ofrecer atenci&oacute;n compasiva y personalizada para adultos mayores.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvv-card" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: center; border-top: 4px solid #f59e0b;">
          <div class="mvv-icon" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #fef3c7; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 14px auto; font-size: 1.4rem;">&#127752;</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">Visi&oacute;n</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6;">Ser la plataforma l&iacute;der en cuidado geri&aacute;trico, conectando familias con cuidadores expertos de excelencia humana.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="mvv-card valores-box" style="background: white; border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #f3f4f6; text-align: center; border-top: 4px solid #10b981;">
          <div class="mvv-icon" style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background: #dcfce7; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 14px auto; font-size: 1.4rem;">&#128142;</div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1f2937;">Valores</h3>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center;">
            <li style="background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Empat&iacute;a</li>
            <li style="background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Respeto</li>
            <li style="background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Compromiso</li>
            <li style="background: #f3f4f6; color: #374151; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Inclusi&oacute;n</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

   <%- include('../partials/footer'); %>
</body>
</html>
